WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: it

00:00:07.840 --> 00:00:13.380
La neve che cade sopra di me copre tutto col suo oblio

00:00:14.420 --> 00:00:20.440
In questo remoto regno la regina sono io

00:00:21.480 --> 00:00:27.280
Le vent qui hurle en moi ne pense plus à demain

00:00:28.320 --> 00:00:33.980
Il est bien trop fort J'ai lutté en vain

00:00:35.440 --> 00:00:38.040
No dejes que sepan de ti

00:00:38.320 --> 00:00:41.140
"que no entren" siempre me dijo a mi

00:00:41.460 --> 00:00:45.980
"lo has de sentir no han de saber"

00:00:46.660 --> 00:00:49.660
¡ya que más da!

00:00:50.100 --> 00:00:53.120
Let it go, let it go

00:00:53.600 --> 00:00:56.600
Can't hold it back anymore

00:00:56.960 --> 00:00:59.720
Let it go, let it go

00:01:00.020 --> 00:01:03.460
Turn away and slam the door

00:01:03.760 --> 00:01:09.640
Es ist Zeit, nun bin ich bereit!

00:01:10.040 --> 00:01:13.160
Und ein Sturm zieht auf

00:01:13.520 --> 00:01:16.020
Die Kälte, sie ist nun ein Teil von mir

00:01:20.680 --> 00:01:26.240
Eu vejo que a distância vai tudo suavizar

00:01:27.280 --> 00:01:33.200
E os medos de outros tempos não me vão apanhar

00:01:34.220 --> 00:01:37.060
E timpul meu sa ma pornesc,

00:01:37.340 --> 00:01:40.560
Sa vad ce pot, ce reusec

00:01:40.760 --> 00:01:47.140
Sa fie numai cum vreau eu, mereu!

00:01:47.800 --> 00:01:50.940
Livre estou, livre estou

00:01:51.200 --> 00:01:54.040
Com o céu e o vento andar

00:01:54.440 --> 00:01:57.620
Livre estou, livre estou

00:01:57.640 --> 00:02:01.060
Não vão me ver chorar

00:02:01.580 --> 00:02:03.500
Sóc aquí!

00:02:04.220 --> 00:02:07.240
I no em mouran!

00:02:07.700 --> 00:02:10.300
Deixa el vent cridar

00:02:15.080 --> 00:02:21.060
Lai šaltis valdo visą žemę šia gale

00:02:21.480 --> 00:02:27.660
Sustingus mano siela šalto ledo kristale

00:02:28.180 --> 00:02:34.060
Et mes pensées sont des fleurs de cristal gelée

00:02:34.860 --> 00:02:41.780
ya no regresaré el pasado ya pasó

00:02:42.200 --> 00:02:48.340
Io lo so, sì lo so, come il sole tramonterò

00:02:48.820 --> 00:02:51.820
Ich bin frei, endlich frei

00:02:52.140 --> 00:02:55.300
Was war ist jetzt vorbei

00:02:56.140 --> 00:03:02.280
Here I stand in the light of day

00:03:03.220 --> 00:03:08.220
Let the storm rage on

00:03:08.660 --> 00:03:11.820
Da oggi il destino appartiene a me

